      "text": "Specialized capabilities and tireless vigilance across 31k+ miles of maritime borders.\n\nIn 4 separate cases last week, #USCG crews from Cutter David Duren, Station San Diego, and Maritime Safety and Security Team San Francisco interdicted 41 aliens attempting illegal entry near San Diego. During multiple pursuits, our crews used advanced tactics to intercept non-compliant vessels and stop human smuggling, in close partnership with U.S. Border Patrol.\n\nA vigilant Coast Guard means a safer nation.\n\n@USCGSouthwest @DHSgov @CBP",
      "text_resolved": "Specialized capabilities and tireless vigilance across 31k+ miles of maritime borders.\n\nIn 4 separate cases last week, #USCG crews from Cutter David Duren, Station San Diego, and Maritime Safety and Security Team San Francisco interdicted 41 aliens attempting illegal entry near San Diego. During multiple pursuits, our crews used advanced tactics to intercept non-compliant vessels and stop human smuggling, in close partnership with U.S. Border Patrol.\n\nA vigilant Coast Guard means a safer nation.\n\n@USCGSouthwest @DHSgov @CBP",
