      "text": "We’re always ready for the call. But when you’re miles from shore and disaster strikes, how will we find you?\n\nOn #406Day, we remind all mariners that a properly registered 406 MHz Emergency Position Indicating Radio Beacon (EPIRB) is your last, best hope at taking the “search” out of search and rescue.\n\nCheck your registration. Check your battery. Stay safe.",
